From 6cf36e9e0775968b018155b302b077aedeed7cf2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:33:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] LatinIME: Let the glass keyboard's backdrop glow follow
 touches

On the RavenOS Glass theme, wrap the keyboard background in a copy of
Settings' GlowBackdrop and feed it the keyboard's touches, so a soft
glow in raven_touch_glow follows the finger behind the keys and fades
after it lifts. Variants turn it off by making the color transparent.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I3b4b51c8cfdcaef9d920f029329c7d987fa514b9
---
