 .../inputmethod/keyboard/GlowBackdrop.java    | 307 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../keyboard/MainKeyboardView.java            |  13 +
 3 files changed, 324 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 java/src/com/android/inputmethod/keyboard/GlowBackdrop.java

